WEBVTT

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.870
Goodbye, Griffith.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.870
How are you feeling, Ilie?

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:33.910
Dad...

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.040
You've never called me that before.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.000
You're the one who never let me, Franz.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.250
Not that I care at this point.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.370
Sorry, Ilie.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.160
I just don't think I can
ever feel love for you.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.160
I became your father
because it was Tania's wish,

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.120
but truthfully, I never wanted
to leave my DNA behind in this world.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.870
You hold Emeth Chilio's hope and despair.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.500
Those are my struggles.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.160
That's why...

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.080
Welcome...

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.410
new queen.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.410
You're gonna go rescue Ilie?

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.080
Then we'll help, too.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.160
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.910
It's not that easy, right?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.540
In that moment, I was so scared...

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.500
I couldn't say anything to her.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:57.660
But I don't want a goodbye like that.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.410
"Wherever you are,
we'll always be friends."

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.910
Please, tell Ilie that.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.200
On one condition.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.330
You go to 01's school.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.700
Passing up on an opportunity

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:15.330
is like stepping over everyone
who never got that opportunity.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.290
I know.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.700
All right. Then I'll deliver your message.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.950
West gate neutralized.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.160
Several vigilantes who were resisting
have been captured.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.410
It's oddly quiet.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:37.750
They're closing off escape routes in hopes
the Bazaar Overseer will surrender.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.950
They're trying to capture
the control tower without any damage.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.790
You're seriously gonna go?

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.450
The Bazaar Overseer
thinks we're traitors. He may kill you.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.410
It'll be the same if we stay.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.540
Remaining enemy found. Mopping up now!

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.120
-Get on!
-Mr. Kidow.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:06.500
Did you say 07?

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.410
Ilie's mom is there.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:12.500
Well, that means her dad's
last wish has been granted now.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:13.660
What are you saying?

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:17.160
Tell me the truth.
Is that girl really safe?

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:19.950
You don't change.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.700
What are you laughing at?

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.370
Three years ago,
you picked me up when I was dying.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.500
When I tried to leave without saying
anything, you beat me up...

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.160
The way you excessively care reminds me
of my sister in the Far East.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.950
Although, you guys
don't look anything alike.

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.450
Thanks for always helping me out.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.450
These past three years, there was
never a day I wasn't grateful to you.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:49.250
I tried to leave so many times,
but I never could.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.660
Until now.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:54.370
You can get rid of my belongings.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.120
Don't expect her to return, either.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.830
Is Ilie really safe?

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.830
Oh, okay. Fine.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.580
Then do whatever you want.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:12.000
But whatever happens,
I'll always be on both your sides.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.250
If you ever want to return,
come back anytime.

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.660
We're counting on you, Mr. Kidow.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:28.250
Hadi...

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:29.620
I want some meat.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.660
Aisha, treat me when I get back.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.410
Sure, but nowhere expensive, okay?

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.660
The day after tomorrow's payday, right?
Let's go all out.

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.330
Then I leave the reservations to you.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.790
Jeez, don't blow me off.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.040
Okay.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:53.660
<i>This is all Area E Inspector-General</i>
<i>Adham's scheme.</i>

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.790
We are not involved!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.750
I won't hear it. Off with his head!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:02.330
You don't need to believe it,
but at least listen to what I have to say.

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:06.250
"I have a plan to protect this city."
That's what this guy's saying.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.870
You're telling me to believe some outsider
from the Allied Forces?

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.080
Did you know

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.910
<i>that one of those outsiders risked</i>
<i>his life many times to protect this city?</i>

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:20.000
He watched over the west gate that
everyone abandoned until the very end.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.250
The tanker who became a Cagaster
and died, huh...

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.500
You don't need to believe it,
just listen to what I have to say.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.450
At this rate,
I can't show my face to Qasim.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.290
He was such a useless man.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.080
Let's hear your so-called plan.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.910
It's a tribute to the outsider
who became 05's soil.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.450
<i>Do you find it strange</i>
<i>that they don't attack?</i>

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:55.250
Your mother is fulfilling
her duty as the queen.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.410
Thanks to that,
this place is an impenetrable fortress.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:01.410
If anything happens to her,
this place will fall in a second.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.080
That's why Franz is here to prevent that.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.450
But without the queen giving birth
to new offspring,

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.410
the bugs have grown old
and are about to die.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.330
Once 05 falls, I'll have you get to work.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:18.160
We must create a new fortress
that will open up mankind's future.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.540
You're going to turn 05
into an insect cage?

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.500
The residents will each
receive your judgment.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.450
You will sort man from bug.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:29.290
We will only accept humans
as our citizens.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:33.580
Soon a world without
the fear of bugs shall begin.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:37.830
That's only ideal for those who know
they won't turn into bugs.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.620
You're trying to act
as a savior like that?

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:41.830
Don't make me laugh.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.040
You are only a bug in human form.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:52.950
I am going to take back the world
where people can live

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.620
without fear of loved ones
turning into bugs.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.660
I will have you give birth
to the next queen.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.120
If you're obedient,
I'll at least let you choose your mate.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.370
Throw her in the cells.

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.620
If the control tower is taken over,
05 is finished.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.450
Before that happens,
we'll break through the enemy blockade

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.500
and request help from Azuria city.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.080
Azuria, you say?

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.080
Yeah, there's no other choice.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.290
The enemy's main troops
are at the south gate.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:35.750
That's why we'll create a diversion
at the west gate,

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.370
where enemy forces are scarce.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:41.330
We'll take advantage of the confusion
and send out a messenger to Azuria.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.200
If worse comes to worst...

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.290
What's this?

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:49.750
It's an EMP jammer.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.290
Its effective range
is a three-meter radius.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.040
It doesn't look that great,

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:56.370
but this'll take out
the enemy's electronic devices.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:59.290
So, we plug their ears and then what?

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.160
We get rid of what they want most.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.870
There's no time, hurry!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:13.000
Hey, Hadi. Why do you go this far?

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.450
<i>The Far East and 07,</i>

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.660
<i>two cities turned into</i>
<i>insect cages overnight.</i>

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.000
<i>Adham's troops were stationed</i>
<i>at both places.</i>

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:25.250
<i>They're trying to turn 05</i>
<i>into an insect cage, too.</i>

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:28.450
Even I could easily imagine that.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:30.870
And you, Mr. Kidow?

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:34.000
"I fight because I don't wanna die."
That good enough?

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:37.790
If it were Qasim,
he'd probably have a more noble reason.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:41.370
Right.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:44.160
We won't let this city
turn into an insect cage.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:48.160
<i>That's enough reason to act right now.</i>

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.500
Dawn is near.

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:55.160
Are you willing to surrender now?

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:58.450
Before you fools came,
acting like you owned the place,

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.950
we survived in the world of bugs.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.290
I will not let you insult our pride.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:08.330
Soldiers,
allow me to show you the way to the oasis.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:13.080
Squeaky cornered rats.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.750
Once the M1 arrives,
we'll begin the attack.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.250
Yes, sir.

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:56.040
We're going to fire.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.500
Begin fire.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.540
Don't shoot.
They'll hit the control tower.

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:09.870
How petty.

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:11.540
Open the gates.

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:15.540
We'll start the invasion
with M1, M4 and the armored cars.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.160
Self-propelled artillery, stand by.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.040
Once the smoke clears, begin fire.

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:23.040
<i>We'll exterminate those rats.</i>

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.620
Five minutes after sunset.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.120
No enemy fire.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.830
The smoke will hold for 30 minutes...

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.080
No, 20 minutes tops.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.870
<i>Please, Mr. Kidow.</i>

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.000
Roger.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.200
It's a sniper!

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:53.910
Enemy attacks! Don't let them escape!

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.500
Watch out for snipers!

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:57.950
What?

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.830
Succeeded in the west gate's diversion.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.540
Leave the rest to us, Mr. Kidow.

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.120
-What's the matter?
-The power...

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.750
-The radio's out.
-What?

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.540
They're fighting back.

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.950
Damn. I wanna fight, too.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.950
What's that?

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:36.040
We've released the west gate's prisoners.
Feel free to go wild.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.250
Roger that.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.790
West gate's prisoners, all released.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:41.700
The wind?

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.160
At a time like this...

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:49.540
Kidow!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.370
Hurry. Now's our chance
to exit the west gate.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.910
Leave it to me!

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:01.450
Follow me!

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.290
Communication won't recover.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.580
-We'll fire by eye. Prepare to fire.
-Yes, sir.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.000
West gate's M4s, all neutralized.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.000
Now, Mr. Kidow.

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:20.830
Nice!

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:23.160
-Go!
-We're counting on you!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:30.540
Jin, we're taking a detour.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.450
Huh, where? The bathroom?

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.370
What?

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:39.950
Now...

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.830
Let's clear things up.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.540
Sorry... Dad.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.290
I wanted to...

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.450
die with you back then...

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:04.080
So, after you rescue her,
what are you gonna do?

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:09.450
Maybe it was actually her fate
to die here with her father.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.870
But it didn't end up that way.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.830
Then that must be fate, too.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:18.250
See ya, you lousy merchant.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.910
So long, Kidow.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:45.410
<i>Franz, Tania...</i>

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.950
<i>this is the new form of humans.</i>

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:51.410
<i>The next mankind to live the future.</i>

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.750
Oh, the ones who break the human mold.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:56.830
Oh, innocent Cagaster.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:01.910
Consume this old, pitiful body
that was left behind in evolution.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.250
Change it into your flesh and blood,

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:07.790
and take me with you to your future!

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:09.950
Dad!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.120
You probably won't forgive me...

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.000
Griffith.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:47.620
Never thought there'd be a day
I'd enter an insect cage as a human.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.370
My only hope is this map
from a decade ago.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.790
But I don't know where anything is
in this state...

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:11.080
Is it calling for the queen?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.620
Is this...?

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.080
Did they come to die?

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.330
Are you being sentimental?

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.120
Sentimental?

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:40.040
Adham's so-called
"recovery of mankind's world."

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:44.500
You may be worshiped
as a savior later in the world.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.330
If Cagasters are an evolution,

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:50.950
can you really say that it's good
for mankind to suppress it?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.700
No. Actually, I've never
even thought of that before.

00:17:57.250 --> 00:18:00.160
Acht, do you hate me?

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.160
What about you?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.660
"Cagaster Biological Laboratory."

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.250
So, this was where Ilie was born.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:20.500
Why aren't they attacking?

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.120
Who's there?

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.370
Damn it.

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.250
Can you let me out of here?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.500
They don't listen to what I say at all...

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.450
There was an explosion near Tower No. 5.

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.910
It was reported to have been an intruder.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:53.080
Is it an agent of the Allied Forces?

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:56.000
-That is...
-Search and kill them.

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:57.000
Yes, sir.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.950
Your Excellency!  Specimen No. 8...

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.830
Franz. Where's Franz?

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.790
I'm here, Your Excellency.

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:20.540
Professor! Call the medical team.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:23.580
It's not my blood, so, don't worry.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:26.200
Did you make Acht do this?

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:27.450
Of course not.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:31.250
You know he's not a child
who'd listen to anyone's orders.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.750
But...

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.500
he did take the key for the handcuff.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.410
Bring that girl to the main tower.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:42.500
-Yes, sir.
-Specimen No. 8 is gonna steal the girl.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.120
<i>Nine lab workers dead at main tower.</i>

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:49.330
<i>Shoot Specimen No. 8 to kill on sight.</i>

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.700
-What's going on?
-Probably the usual error.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:58.870
She doesn't look like a monster to me.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.660
Ain't she pretty cute?

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:04.750
-You're gonna get it afterwards.
-It won't hurt

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.870
to have a little fun, right?

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:07.870
Stop it!

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.450
Even that voice of resistance is cute.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:13.160
You're sick to mess
with a monster like that.

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:18.330
Thanks to your mom,

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.250
my hometown ended up like this.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.540
It started moving already.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.410
So, they've locked me in.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.790
<i>Franz, I'm heading over to see you now.</i>

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:55.330
<i>To the place where you and Tania are.</i>

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.160
Griffith...

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.580
Griffith's will?

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.160
Search Tower No. 5's security room.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:04.830
Damn Allied Forces' dogs...

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:05.910
No...

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.790
He came to see Ilie.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.450
He's probably her friend.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.450
<i>The Exterminator of the Far East.</i>

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:30.830
That's what they get for sitting back,
relying on the bug's protection.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.200
The soldiers here are all wusses.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.500
Why don't you run?

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:36.620
You can't stay here anymore, right?

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:37.950
What about you?

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.040
I don't have anywhere to go anyway...

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:43.870
You're gonna be their puppet...

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:45.790
and become a disposable queen?

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:48.790
That's what I was born for anyway.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.250
<i>I'm the same as Mom.</i>

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:55.290
<i>I'm a monster that creates insect cages</i>
<i>by turning humans into bugs.</i>

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.910
No... I'm just a tool.

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:02.250
Acht, you hate me, too, don't you?

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:05.120
Since I was born, you were...

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:09.080
You say you're the same as Tania?

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:12.750
Tania chose Franz herself,

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:14.910
gave herself up to research

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:18.160
and stepped onto the throne
with her own two feet.

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:20.830
She is not a pitiful tool whatsoever.

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:27.330
Ten years ago,

00:22:27.540 --> 00:22:29.790
I could neither become bug nor man,

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:32.410
so, I decided to become a monster.

00:22:33.200 --> 00:22:37.000
I prey on humans and oppose
Exterminators who hunt bugs...

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:40.500
The one and only monster in this world.

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:42.660
Do I disgust you?

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:51.870
Not everyone can walk down
a satisfying path in life.

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:57.000
There's nothing you desire
in the paths prepared for you, is there?

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:01.870
Even if all of them
have a predictable ending,

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:04.080
you gotta choose one yourself.

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:06.040
Stand tall...

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>and challenge that ending head-on.</i>

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:11.080
<i>Little Bo Peep,</i>

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:15.040
<i>the shepherd's dream ends here.</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:23.200
Open your eyes and survive until the end.

00:23:23.910 --> 00:23:26.330
You gotta search for
your own life's worth yourself.

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:28.750
Acht.

00:23:29.370 --> 00:23:31.910
I gotta go see Mom.

00:23:34.200 --> 00:23:35.580
You know where the throne is?

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:38.790
We went to visit it many times
when we were kids.

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:43.330
Specimen No. 8, spotted!

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:44.700
The girl's with him.

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:57.200
About what you said earlier...

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:58.290
Acht!

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:00.250
I've never hated you.

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.540
I hesitated at first,

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:05.250
but I'm glad that you were born...

00:24:05.830 --> 00:24:07.200
from the bottom of my heart.

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:10.250
Goodbye, Ilie.

00:24:16.830 --> 00:24:17.750
<i>Acht...</i>

00:24:24.290 --> 00:24:25.580
Now, humans...

00:24:26.330 --> 00:24:28.500
it's about time you pay up.

00:24:29.540 --> 00:24:34.370
For the cost of stealing the king's name
in the Cagaster's nest these ten years...

00:24:35.750 --> 00:24:38.200
don't expect your limbs...

00:24:39.040 --> 00:24:40.580
to be enough!
